Tri-Arm reconstruction for the garden viewer.
Project: https://tnkr.ai/theaiwhisperers-workspace/tri-arm
Wearable extra limb: SO-100 on a shoulder harness and belt, plus an
8-DOF four-finger hand. Tnkr is login-walled and has no public URDF.
The torso is a headless dress form so it reads as a worn third arm,
not a humanoid. Arm meshes are Apache-2.0 SO-100.
SO-100 meshes: public/robots/so100 (TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100).
